{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/00e82a37f09852912bc99fc0859139d0.avif?t=1763488858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras_big/00e82a37f09852912bc99fc0859139d0.webp?t=1763488858 width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hangtime!</i> is a wild volleyball roguelite where spikes fly, blocks crash, and momentum swings in a heartbeat.\u00a0Go <strong>solo</strong>, or duo up in frantic <strong>local co-op!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/6999579e8a3a18900e2ba66f0ea39ab1.avif?t=1763488858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras_big/6999579e8a3a18900e2ba66f0ea39ab1.webp?t=1763488858 width=1560 height=549 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/7889398d9ed7849d8c4d6796be7fa306.avif?t=1763488858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras_big/7889398d9ed7849d8c4d6796be7fa306.webp?t=1763488858 width=1560 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own playstyle as abilities stack and collide, turning each run into something precise, chaotic, or unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few favorites:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadball Set</strong> \u2013 sets hang at their highest point, letting you reposition last second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hook Tip</strong> \u2013 fast, sharp drop that dodges blockers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pipe</strong> \u2013 leap from the back row for huge surprise spikes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/425c702d3846f994faaad44390f733bc.poster.avif?t=1763488858\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/425c702d3846f994faaad44390f733bc.webm?t=1763488858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/425c702d3846f994faaad44390f733bc.mp4?t=1763488858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/6685b85e9f45539a0678f1aec72fa185.avif?t=1763488858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras_big/6685b85e9f45539a0678f1aec72fa185.webp?t=1763488858 width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power hitters, stone walls, speedsters \u2014 every team pushes you to the edge. Learn how to fight and adapt to each of their play styles, and fast! The higher you rise in a tournament, the more bold and dominant your opponents become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you rise to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/e7e335b6558353a46f212ab77b279d15.poster.avif?t=1763488858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861120/extras/e7e335b6558353a46f212ab77b279d15.webm?t=1